<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria offers 17.2 bln ATS for CA - Klima.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria offers 17.2 bln ATS for CA - Klima.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Finance Minister Viktor Klima said on Sunday Bank Austria had offered a total of 17.2 billion schillings for the state's 70 percent voting stake in Creditanstalt and that the sale to Bank Austria will be closed on Sunday.  </p>
<p>&quot;The transaction will be closed immediately, I will go to my office right now and sign the contract,&quot; he told reporters after a marathon session of coalition crisis talks. -- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
